# about

The list of {{ models }} in the order the site shows them. Each row opens its form.

# howto

## How to add a {{ model }}

1. Press «New {{ model }}» at the top of the list.
2. Fill in «Title» in the default language, and in the others if the site has them.
3. Press «Save».

## How to change the order

1. Clear the search.
2. Drag a row by its grip. The new order saves itself.

## How to delete a {{ model }}

1. In the menu of the row, press «Delete» and confirm. There is no bin: it is gone for good.
